---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../site.config';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Use" description="The terms that govern your use of SmallNestDecor.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 pt-12 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-cocoa">Last updated: October 20, 2026</p>
    <div class="prose-nest mt-6">
      <p>Welcome to {siteConfig.name}. By accessing {siteConfig.url} you agree to these Terms of Use. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.</p>
      <h2>Content is for inspiration and general information</h2>
      <p>The articles, ideas, and guides on this site are provided for general information and inspiration only. They are not professional interior-design, construction, or legal advice. Paint colors shown on screen vary by device and lighting, always test a sample in your own room before committing. Before making changes to a rental property, check your lease and, where needed, ask your landlord. You are responsible for decisions you make based on our content.</p>
      <h2>Images</h2>
      <p>Some imagery on this site consists of AI-generated inspiration renders, as disclosed on our About page. They illustrate ideas and are not photographs of real rooms or guarantees of how a product or color will appear in your home.</p>
      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>Text, design, and original imagery on this site belong to {siteConfig.name} unless credited otherwise. You may share links and short excerpts with credit and a link back. Please do not republish full articles, or reuse our images commercially, without written permission. Paint color names are trademarks of their respective brands and are used for identification only.</p>
      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>We link to retailers and other websites we do not control. We are not responsible for their content, prices, or availability. Some links are affiliate links, see our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure">Affiliate Disclosure</a>.</p>
      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>The site is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. To the fullest extent permitted by law, {siteConfig.name} is not liable for any damages arising from your use of the site or reliance on its content.</p>
      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may revise these terms from time to time; the version on this page, with its date, is the one that applies.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
